  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Licensing and pipeline\n- License validation uses ILicenseProductInfo (default LicenseProductInfo). CheckLicense runs Validate for all registered ILicenseProductInfo (extensions can register additional implementations).\n- LicenseCheckBehavior order is -2; order -1 is reserved for Cross.CQRS.EF (EfLicenseCheckBehavior).\n- InternalsVisibleTo Cross.CQRS.EF for shared licensing types.\nDependencies\n- Per-TFM Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration / Logging: 8.0.x on netstandard2.1 and net6.0–net8.0; 9.0.14 on net9.0; 10.0.5 on net10.0.\n- FluentValidation 11.12.0, MediatR 11.1.0, Microsoft.IdentityModel.JsonWebTokens 8.17.0, Scrutor 4.2.2 (unchanged).",
